API Needs Statement
1. SkillBridge needs to read a list of Maji customer estates with active delivery schedules, to recommend local skill-exchange sessions to users in the same neighborhoods.
2. SkillBridge needs to read each water vendor's station name and primary target estate, to suggest those vendor locations as physical meetup venues for skill sessions.
3. SkillBridge needs to read the daily delivery volume (liters) per estate, to prioritize advertising skill sessions in high-water-demand areas where more residents are active.
4. SkillBridge needs to read Maji customers' M-Pesa payment history (payment method only, not amount)
5.SkillBridge needs to read delivery time windows (e.g., morning/afternoon) per estate, to schedule skill session reminders during waiting periods when customers are likely free.

